  nodes:
  - id: darwin_rdy
    text: That was like listening to music, thank you stranger! You helped me out
      in my research. I am anticipating the leave of my crew and myself in a few
      days even more now. This tank here will help you to use your fuel more efficently.
      Stay safe and always listen to the sounds of nature!
